     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Molly -<div><br></div><div>I asked the Shinyapps.io team, and they suggested installing the latest version of shinyapps from github. If you still have issues, please let us know.</div><div><br></div><div>-Winston</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, Oct 7, 2014 at 8:13 AM, Molly Hanlon <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">hanl...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">My ggvis wrapped in shiny app runs great locally, but when I try to deploy it to Shinyapps.io, I get the following error (other things install fine):<div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2014</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">07T13</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">08</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">57.346567862</span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Building</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> R </span><span style=\"color:#008\">package</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lazyeval </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">9</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mnt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">build </span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mnt<br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Warning</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> untar2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tarfile</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> files</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> exdir</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> restore_times</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  skipping pax </span><span style=\"color:#008\">global</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> extended headers<br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> installing to library </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">usr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#008\">local</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lib</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">site</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">’</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>ERROR</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">this</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> R </span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> version </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3.0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">package</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;lazyeval&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> requires R </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3.1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">################################### End Log ################################### </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Unhandled</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Exception</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Child</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Task</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1970083</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> failed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> building image</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> building lazyeval </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">9</span><span style=\"color:#660\">).</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Build</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> exited </span><span style=\"color:#008\">with</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> non</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">zero status</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Execution</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> halted</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></